-- (3): marked with a recorded or registered brand, evidence to the contrary
#ASSERT `s 338(3) the evidence is proof that the cattle are owned by the registered owner of the brand or mark` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 338(3) the evidence is proof that the cattle are owned by the registered owner of the brand or mark` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 338(3) the evidence is proof that the cattle are owned by the registered owner of the brand or mark` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 338(3) the evidence is proof that the cattle are owned by the registered owner of the brand or mark` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4): charged under (1) or (2), the accused is the registered owner, possession was without the accused's knowledge and authority, sanction or approval
#ASSERT `s 338(4) the burden of proving that the cattle came lawfully into possession is on the accused` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 338(4) the burden of proving that the cattle came lawfully into possession is on the accused` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 338(4) the burden of proving that the cattle came lawfully into possession is on the accused` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 338(4) the burden of proving that the cattle came lawfully into possession is on the accused` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

