-- intercept includes
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) intercept` `s 342.1(2) to listen to a function of a computer system` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) intercept` `s 342.1(2) to record a function of a computer system` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) intercept` `s 342.1(2) to acquire the substance, meaning or purport of a function of a computer system` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) intercept` `s 342.1(2) another act` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) the person traffics in the computer password` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.1(2) the person traffics in the computer password` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 342.2 possession of a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system`
-- without lawful excuse, makes/possesses/sells/..., the thing is a device (s 342.2(4)), designed or adapted primarily to commit an offence under s 342.1 or 430, knows it has been or is intended to be used
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE TRUE NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(1) the punishment for the offence` `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to two years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`
#ASSERT `s 342.2(2) the device may be ordered forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(2) the device may be ordered forfeited to Her Majesty` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 342.2(2) the device may be ordered forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 342.2(3) an order of forfeiture is barred` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(3) an order of forfeiture is barred` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
